<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Roadcorp to raise 44.7 million rand.</title>
<headline>Roadcorp to raise 44.7 million rand.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African group Roadcorp Ltd said on Monday that it aims to raise 44.7 million rand via a rights issue.</p>
<p>About 23.5 million new shares are to be offered for subscription in the ratio of 90 new ordinary shares for every 100 ordinary shares already held at a price of 190 cents a new share.</p>
<p>Roadcorp Ltd has previously said the funds raised by an issue will help reduce debt and finance future growth.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
